== Trivia ==
*It is also possible to mine the various valuable blocks (Pure Gold, Diamond, Emerald, Redstone) within the Mines for resources, and is a good way to get {{skl|mining|XP}}.
**Coal blocks can also be found on the edges, however they do not give {{skl|mining|XP}} and higher blocks are hard to reach, therefore it is generally not recommended to mine coal there.
**Wearing {{Item|Mineral Armor}} is the most effective way to clear out the gold blocks.
*Occasionally, the structure generation inside the Mines of Divan will stop certain [[Keepers]] from spawning, and thus the crystal cannot be obtained.
**This seems to mainly happen to the Keeper of Gold.
**This bug has existed since at least September 2021.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=96kxpBUyylI</ref>
*"The dwarves delved too greedily and too deep." is a reference to Saruman from ''The Lord of the Rings'' describing a creature the dwarves awoke in the depths of Khazad-dûm.
*This structure contains a massive amount of Jade Gemstone ores, mostly full blocks rather than panes, which makes it an ideal place to collect Jades and make coins.

